n Deadline: November 10, 2025 Quinn Professor in Sustainability - Application Deadline: November 24, 2025 Links to other academic positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Smith School of Business - Join our ranks Faculty of Education Expand All Collapse All Tenure-track positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible None available at this time Links to other academic positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Faculty of Education - Work at Queen's Smith Engineering Expand All Collapse All Tenure-track positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Electrical and Computer Engineering Tier 2 CRC in Supercomputing and High Performance Computing - Application Deadline: November 1, 2025 Microelectronics and Photonics (Teaching-Focused) - Application Deadline: March 7, 2026 Robert M. Buchan Department of Mining Surface and Underground Mining (Teaching-Focused) - Application Deadline: March 1, 2026 Chemical Engineering Tier 2 CRC in Cell Engineering and Biomanufacturing - Application Deadline: January 31, 2026 Mechanical Engineering Biomechanical Engineering with a specialization in Human Motion Analysis - Application Deadline: March 31, 2026 Links to other academic positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Chemical Engineering Civil Engineering Electrical and Computer Engineering Mechanical and Materials Engineering Robert M. Buchan Department of Mining Faculty of Health Sciences Expand All Collapse All Tenure-track positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Centre for Neuroscience Studies Neuro-Artificial Intelligence (AI) - Application Deadline: January 30, 2026 Biomedical and Molecular Sciences Mitchell Chair in Neonatal Immunology - Application Deadline: March 30, 2025 Tier 1 Canada Research Chair/ Mitchell Chair - Application Deadline: January 1, 2026 Anatomical Sciences - Application Deadline: January 12, 2026 Public Health Sciences QNS in Cancer Epidemiology - Application Deadline: January 5, 2026 Links to other academic positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Health Sciences Careers Anesthesiology and Perioperative Medicine Biomedical and Molecular Sciences Canadian Cancer Trials Group (CCTG) Critical Care Medicine Diagnostic Radiology Emergency Medicine Family Medicine Department of Medicine Obstetrics and Gynaecology Oncology Ophthalmology Office of Professional Development and Educational Scholarship (OPDES) Pathology and Molecular Medicine Pediatrics Physical Medicine and Rehabilitation Psychiatry Public Health Sciences Surgery Urology School of Nursing School of Rehabilitation Therapy Faculty of Law Expand All Collapse All Tenure-track positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Law and Public Policy - Application Deadline: August 11, 2026 Links to other academic positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Faculty of Law - Academic Career Opportunities Queen's University Library & Queen's University Archives Expand All Collapse All Continuing-track positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Teaching and Outreach Archivist/Librarian - Application Deadline: October 18, 2023 Links to other academic positions Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Queen's University Library - Careers Recently Closed Positions Searches for these positions are underway and applications are no longer being accepted at this time. Expand All Collapse All Faculty of Arts and Science Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Department of Physics CERC in Astroparticle Physics - Application Deadline: June 21, 2025 (possibility of extension until filled) Kinesiology and Health Studies Exercise Physiology - Application Deadline: April 4, 2025 Department of Mathematics and Statistics Mathematical Sciences - Application Deadline: January 3, 2025 Department of Chemistry C2MCI Mitchell Chair - Tenure Track Position in Nanomaterials and Surface Science - Application Deadline: March 28, 2025 CERC in Precision Materials Chemistry - Application Deadline: June 8, 2025 (possibility of extension until filled) Biology and Environmental Studies Queen's National Scholar in Indigenous Science - Application Deadline: Applications will be accepted until the position is successfully filled. CRC Tier 1 in Paleolimnology - Application Deadline: September 10, 2025 Smith School of Business Open Collapsible Close Collapsible no recent searches Smith Engineering Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Smith Engineering Professorship in Interdisciplinary Engineering - Application Deadline: May 31, 2025 CERC in Artificial Intelligence and Exascale Computing - Application Deadline: June 8, 2025 Mechanical and Materials Engineering Defects in Materials or Nuclear Materials - Application Deadline: February 28, 2025 Interdisciplinary Smith Engineering Chair in Engineering for Humanity - Application Deadline: May 31, 2025 Mining Mineral Processing and Metallurgy - Application Deadline: August 1, 2025 Mine Planning and Design, Orebody Modelling and Geostatistics - Application Deadline: September 1, 2025 Faculty of Education Open Collapsible Close Collapsible no recent searches Faculty of Health Sciences Open Collapsible Close Collapsible no recent searches Faculty of Law Open Collapsible Close Collapsible Tax Law - Application Deadline: November 22, 2024 Labour and Employment Law - Application Deadline: January 5, 2025 International Economic Law - Application Deadline: December 7, 2025 Queen's University 99 University Ave. Kingston, ON K7L 3N6 Canada Faculty Positions on X/Twitter Faculty Positions on Facebook Faculty Positions on Youtube Footer menu Office of the Provost Human Resources Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
