      "title": "Employment",
      "description": "Employment | School of Kinesiology and Health Studies Cookie Disclosure Queen's University uses cookies to provide the best possible online experience. Learn about our privacy practices. OK Skip to main content Skip to footer School of Kinesiology and Health Studies Sign In University Wide MyQueen’sU - SOLUS, MyHR, and more Microsoft 365 Outlook on the web - Email onQ Research–Service Portal: Cayuse and TRAQ Course Reserves Web Proxy Change password / Manage NetID Faculty/School Portals Business - Program Portals Grad Studies – Faculty and Staff Portal Health Sciences - Elentra Law - QLaw Smith Engineering Intranet School of Kinesiology and Health Studies Main navigation Home About Us People Down arrow Faculty Staff Cross-appointed Faculty Teaching Adjuncts Teaching Fellows Adjunct 1 Students Down arrow Undergraduate Studies Current Students Awards Course Information Certificate in Disability and Physical Activity (DIPA) Graduate Studies Overview Down arrow Graduate Studies SKHS Graduate Student Handbook Community Down arrow Community Overview Courses with Community Engagement How to Get Involved SKHS Community Outreach Programs Student Initiatives in the Community Employment Down arrow Current Opportunities News & Events Down arrow SKHS News Overview Research Contact Us Employment Employment Employment The School of Kinesiology and Health Studies provides employment for staff, faculty members, teaching adjuncts, teaching fellows, teaching assistants, postdoctoral fellows, and supporting adjuncts. Expand All Collapse All Teaching Assistant Open Collapsible Close Collapsible There are no positions available at this time. Teaching Adjunct Open Collapsible Close Collapsible We are currently inviting applications from qualified candidates interested in teaching An Introduction to Drugs, Drug Use, and Drug Dependence (HLTH 237) . Applications will be received until August 28th, 2026. Please see the job posting below for more information. HLTH 237 Teaching Fellow Open Collapsible Close Collapsible There are no positions available at this time. Postdoctoral Fellow Open Collapsible Close Collapsible There are no positions available at this time. Faculty Open Collapsible Close Collapsible There are no positions available at this time. Staff Open Collapsible Close Collapsible There are no positions available at this time. School of Kinesiology and Health Studies 28 Division Street, Queens University Kingston, Ontario K7L3N6 Canada Tel: 613-533-2666 skhs.admin@queensu.ca School of Kinesiology and Health Studies on Facebook School of Kinesiology and Health Studies on Instagram Hours Monday to Friday 8:30 am – Noon; 1:00 pm – 4:30 pm (closed between noon – 1pm daily) Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
