 most historic medical faculties in Canada. Queen’s University is consistently a top ranked university in Canada. The clinical programs in Medicine occur in three teaching hospitals in Kingston. One of these (Kingston General Hospital) has been ranked as one of the best hospitals in North America.  We are committed to recruiting leading practitioners, researchers and administrative staff to continue our excellence in education, research and clinical care. Faculty Opportunities » Administrative Opportunities » PostDoc Opportunities » Careers - Sub Menu Faculty Opportunities Administrative Opportunities PostDoc Opportunities New Employee Orientation Queen's University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek Faculty of Health Sciences School of Medicine School of Nursing School of Rehabilitation Therapy Contact Us Department of Medicine, School of Medicine (613) 533-2967 medicine@queensu.ca Queen’s University Affiliated Hospitals Kingston Health Sciences Centre Providence Care Copyright © Faculty of Health Sciences - Queen's University Website Privacy Statement"
