dies at Queen’s University invites applications from suitably qualified candidates interested in teaching a cross-listed course in Judaism in the Modern Age (RELS 398/897). This is an on-campus, upper-level lecture course with an expected enrolment of ~35 students. The deadline to submit an application is June 2, 2023. Job Description Here Article Category Employment Opportunities News Queen's School of Religion Theological Hall, Suite 211 Kingston, ON K7L 3N6 Canada Tel: 613 533 2106 School of Religion on Facebook Footer menu Campus Security Accessibility Services Accessibility Services Wellness Services Student Wellness Services Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
