      "description": "Employment Opportunities - Queen's School of Computing Skip to content Employment Opportunities Menu Home Welcome to the School of Computing’s Employment Opportunities site . This is where you will find job postings for positions within the School of Computing. Positions like: faculty, instructor, teaching assistant, postdoctoral fellow, etc. Open Positions Academic Assistant Position available in the School of Computing August 25, 2026 We are now accepting applications for an Academic Assistant position in the School of Computing for December 1, 2026 to… Read More Search Search How to Apply Applying for a Teaching Fellow Position Applying for a Teaching Adjunct Position Applying for a Teaching Assistant (TA) Position Other Links More information for Teaching Assistants Onboarding Timeline FAQ 557 Goodwin Hall Queen's University Kingston, Ontario, Canada K7L 2N8 Queen’s University is situated on traditional Anishinaabe and Haudenosaunee Territory ."
