wn arrow ConEd Degree Requirements ConEd Supports and Services Regulations and Policies Teacher Candidates Down arrow Academic Calendar Awards Course Descriptions Regulations and Policies Supports for Teacher Candidates on Practicum TC Supports & Services Graduate Students Down arrow Academic Calendar Grad - Supports & Services Grad Office Resources Down arrow Event Calendar Indigenous Education Supports Student Services Office Research Down arrow Overview Research Profiles Ethics Events & Publications Down arrow Knowledge Forum RBJSE Research Newsletter Centre for Community Engagement and Social Change Research Groups For Teachers Down arrow Podcast: Popular Podagogy AI in the Classroom International Teaching and Practicum Practicum Information Teaching Resources About Down arrow About Down arrow Our Deans Academic Plan Equity & Diversity Faculty Board News Down arrow Media Releases Event Calendar Work With Us Duncan McArthur Hall Down arrow Construction Updates Maps Room Reservations Continuing Education, Professional, & Global Programs Down arrow Continuing Teacher Education Professional Studies School of English Site Illustrations Contact Us Down arrow Contact Us People Directory Hire our Graduates Down arrow Options Career Fair Supports Down arrow Technology and Facilities Services Personal Counsellors About - Tsi Nahò:ten - E Teg Work At Queen's Term Adjunct Positions Available Term Adjunct Positions Available Term adjuncts with and without benefits are instructors with a limited-term faculty appointment of one term to three years in duration and with a limited range of academic responsibilities (e.g., instruction/evaluation, coordination/administration). For questions about the term adjunct postings, please contact: employment.education@queensu.ca . Application packages, with all required documentation, should be sent to the email address identified in the application section of each job posting. Faculty of Education Duncan McArthur Hall 511 Union Street King