    "https://www.queensu.ca/physics/queens-national-scholar-qns-senior-faculty-position": {
      "title": "Access denied",
      "description": "Access denied | Department of Physics, Engineering Physics & Astronomy Cookie Disclosure Queen's University uses cookies to provide the best possible online experience. Learn about our privacy practices. OK Skip to main content Skip to footer Sign In University Wide MyQueen’sU - SOLUS, MyHR, and more Microsoft 365 Outlook on the web - Email onQ Research–Service Portal: Cayuse and TRAQ Course Reserves Web Proxy Change password / Manage NetID Faculty/School Portals Business - Program Portals Grad Studies – Faculty and Staff Portal Health Sciences - Elentra Law - QLaw Smith Engineering Intranet The Department of Physics, Engineering Physics & Astronomy Queen's 2015 Nobel Prize in Physics Main menu Megamenu Home About Down arrow History Collections and Artifacts Queen's Observatory Undergrads Down arrow Undergrads Studies Overview Physics & Astronomy Overview Down arrow Physics & Astronomy Program Prospective Undergrad Students Undergraduate Courses Accelerated MSc Careers in Physics & Astronomy Eng Physics Overview Down arrow Engineering Physics Program Engineering Physics Courses Accelerated MASc Careers in Engineering Physics Student Support Down arrow CAP University Prize Exam Physics Drop-In Center TA Award Nomination Tutor List Experience & Employment Opportunities Down arrow Exchange Programs Queen's University Internship Program (QUIP) Student Employment Opportunities Grads Down arrow Applicants Admission Requirements MSc Degree Overview MASc Degree Overview PhD Degree Overview Current Students Down arrow Departmental Procedures & Requirements Grad Course Information Malcolm Stott TA Award Winners Scholarships & Awards Student Wellness Graduate Physics Society (GPS) TA Positions FAQ Research People Down arrow People Directory Admin Staff Affiliated Adjunct Faculty Current Grad Students Emeriti Faculty Research Associates McDonald Institute Admin Staff Post Doctorates Support Staff Technologists/Technicians Term Adjuncts News & Events Down arrow Events Down arrow Upcoming Events Events Calendar Events by Type Departmental Colloquium News Down arrow Recent News Employment Opportunities Student Employment News by Categories Outreach Resources Down arrow Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Facilities IT Support for Physics Physics Technical Resources Physics Safety Information Physics Stores Contact Down arrow Admin Faculty and Staff Directory Directions Make a Donation Queen's 2015 Nobel Prize in Physics System Access denied Access denied You are not authorized to access this page. Physics, Engineering Physics & Astronomy Stirling Hall 64 Bader Lane Kingston, ON K7L 3N6 Canada Tel: 613 533 2707 Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
