      "description": "Job Opportunities | Department of Languages, Literatures and Cultures Cookie Disclosure Queen's University uses cookies to provide the best possible online experience. Learn about our privacy practices. OK Skip to main content Skip to footer Sign In University Wide MyQueen’sU - SOLUS, MyHR, and more Microsoft 365 Outlook on the web - Email onQ Research–Service Portal: Cayuse and TRAQ Course Reserves Web Proxy Change password / Manage NetID Faculty/School Portals Business - Program Portals Grad Studies – Faculty and Staff Portal Health Sciences - Elentra Law - QLaw Smith Engineering Intranet Department of Languages, Literatures and Cultures Main navigation Home Academics Down arrow Why choose LLCU? Academic Plans Down arrow Indigenous Knowledges and Perspectives Languages, Literatures and Cultures Linguistics Spanish and Latin American Studies World Language Studies Our courses Down arrow Current Course Offerings Anishinaabemowin Arabic Chinese German Hebrew INDG courses Italian Japanese LLCU courses Linguistics Mohawk Portuguese Spanish Certificates Academic Advising Awards People Down arrow Regular and Continuing Faculty Term Adjuncts/Teaching Fellows Emeritae/Emeriti and Retired Faculty Staff Alumni Spotlights News About LLCU Down arrow History & today Research Job Opportunities Donate Contact Us About Llcu Job Opportunities Job Opportunities Explore the current list of open positions in the Department of Languages, Literatures and Cultures. Faculty Positions We currently have two Term Adjunct opportunities for the 2026-27 academic year. Expand All Collapse All CHIN 200 Introductory Mandarin Chinese II Open Collapsible Close Collapsible CHIN 200 Introductory Mandarin Chinese II LLCU 111 Introduction to Cultures (Winter Term) Open Collapsible Close Collapsible LLCU 111 Introduction to Cultures Graduate Student Job Opportunities We currently have several Teaching Assistantship opportunities for the 2026 2027 academic year. Expand All Collapse All 2026 2027 Teaching Assistantships in INDG 101/201 Open Collapsible Close Collapsible 2026 2027 Teaching Assistantships in INDG 101 & 201 (Fall & Winter) 2026 2027 Teaching Assistantships in LLCU Open Collapsible Close Collapsible 2026 2027 Teaching Assistantships in LLCU (Fall & Winter) Undergraduate Student Job Opportunities We currently have several Undergraduate Teaching Assistantship opportunities for the 2026-2027 academic year. Expand All Collapse All 2026 2027 Teaching Assistantships in INDG 101 Open Collapsible Close Collapsible 2026 2027 Teaching Assistantships in INDG 101 (Fall & Winter) Department of Languages, Literatures and Cultures, Queen's University Kingston Hall 416, 103 Stuart Street Kingston, ON K7L 3N6 Canada Tel: 613 533 2072 Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
