      "description": "Careers | Family Medicine | School of Medicine | Queen's University Skip to main content Sign In University Wide MyQueen’sU - SOLUS, MyHR, and more Microsoft 365 Outlook on the web - Email onQ Research–Service Portal: Cayuse and TRAQ Course Reserves Web Proxy Change password / Manage NetID Faculty/School Portals Business - Program Portals Grad Studies – Faculty and Staff Portal Health Sciences - Elentra Law - QLaw Smith Engineering Intranet Family Medicine Main navigation Admin|HR Vision/Mission/Values Strategic & Annual Reports Careers Faculty/Staff Physician Wellness Faculty Development Intranet / Elentra Login Contact Us Academics Core Residency Enhanced Skills (PGY3) PHPM Military Applicants IMGs Undergrad Program Sites Hospital Medicine Contact Us Research About Ongoing Research Knowledge Translation CSPC Newsletter Contact Us Community & Partnerships Vision, Mission, and Guiding Principles Global Health at DFM Clinic Education Patient and Family Advisory Committee Patient Care Contact Careers Breadcrumb Home / Administration / Careers Careers Come work with us! Join a vibrant, inclusive community where you can make a meaningful impact in family medicine through clinical practice, teaching, and research—supported every step of the way in an inspiring environment dedicated to equity, diversity, and inclusion. Commitment to equity diversity and inclusion Learn more Advancing primary care through research Learn more Shaping the future of healthcare through clinical teaching Learn more Join a thriving urban family practice in a vibrant community Learn more Current Career Opportunities Faculty Opportunities Hospitalist Physician and Division Chair Providence Care Hospital’s Division of Hospital Medicine (1.0 FTE) - 44-FM The Department of Family Medicine at Queen’s University at Kingston invites applications for a Clinical Academic Hospitalist Physician and Division Chair appointment in Kingston, Ontario Position Details QFHT / Academic Family 