      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers | Pediatrics | Queen's University Skip to main content Sign In University Wide MyQueen’sU - SOLUS, MyHR, and more Microsoft 365 Outlook on the web - Email onQ Research–Service Portal: Cayuse and TRAQ Course Reserves Web Proxy Change password / Manage NetID Faculty/School Portals Business - Program Portals Grad Studies – Faculty and Staff Portal Health Sciences - Elentra Law - QLaw Smith Engineering Intranet Pediatrics Main navigation Home About Welcome from the Head Mission, Vision and Values Careers Academics Undergraduate Pediatric Residency Clinical Our People Faculty & Residents Administration Other Faculty Research Careers Breadcrumb Home / Careers Careers Careers The Department of Pediatrics endeavours to recruit faculty locally, nationally, and internationally to provide the highest quality patient care, education and research. See below for a list of current openings in the Department of Pediatrics: Academic General Pediatrician Neurodevelopmental Pediatrician Academic Pediatric Cardiologist Locum - Pediatric Cardiology Queen's University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek Faculty of Health Sciences School of Medicine School of Nursing School of Rehabilitation Therapy Contact Us Department of Pediatrics Administrative Inquiries: (613) 548-6046 Patient Inquiries: (613) 548-3232 Follow Us Queen’s University Affiliated Hospitals Kingston Health Sciences Centre Providence Care Copyright © Faculty of Health Sciences - Queen's University Website Privacy Statement"
